[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    48[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | E1 | `max_size_frame` | all-zero arguments `(0, 0, 0)` — degenerate/empty shape | no trap; returns `18 + 0 + (0+7)/8` = `18` | `err_e1_all_zero` | [x] |
